Method Endpoint Description <code>GET</code> <code>/github-backup/commits</code> List recent backup commits (<code>limit</code>, 1--100, default 20) <code>GET</code> <code>/github-backup/restore/preview</code> Report which categories a commit contains (<code>ref</code>, default <code>HEAD</code>) <code>POST</code> <code>/github-backup/restore</code> Restore selected categories from one commit <p><code>POST /github-backup/restore</code> takes <code>ref</code> (a commit SHA, or <code>HEAD</code> for the branch tip), <code>categories</code> (one or more of <code>kprofiles</code>, <code>settings</code>, <code>spools</code>, <code>archives</code>), and <code>overwrite_existing</code>:</p> <pre><code>{
  "ref": "debe2cb",
  "categories": ["spools", "settings"],
  "overwrite_existing": false
}
</code></pre>
